<!--
  The speed-limit alert's status-bar icon.

  A notification small icon is drawn as a mask: only the alpha channel survives, and
  the platform tints what is left. So this is flat white on transparent with no
  android:tint of its own — unlike ic_driving_tile.xml, which is a Quick Settings
  tile and is tinted against a theme attribute. A coloured or tinted small icon
  renders as a grey square in the status bar.
-->
